<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>报税 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%8A%A5%E7%A8%8E/</link><description>Recent content in 报税 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E6%8A%A5%E7%A8%8E/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>社保号与报税：申请 SSN、第一次报税、填 W-4、查退税</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/occasions/social-security-and-taxes/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/occasions/social-security-and-taxes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在美国，&lt;strong&gt;Social Security number（社安号）就是你在系统里的那个号码&lt;/strong&gt;：报税要用它，上班要用它，开银行账户要用它，查信用分数也要用它。它只有一个，终身不变；卡丢了可以补办，但号码不会换。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>